      "body": "Thanks for such a clear issue and repro!\n\nConfirmed initial state\n```console\n$ uvx --from rerun-sdk[dataplatform]==0.32.0 --python 3.10 python repro.py \nProperties columns: ['rerun_segment_id', 'property:RecordingInfo:start_time']\nData: Index 'step' does not exist in the dataset.\n```\n\nHave a branch that appears to solve\n```console\n$ pixi run uvpy repro.py \nProperties columns: ['rerun_segment_id', 'step', 'log_time', 'log_tick', 'property:RecordingInfo:start_time', 'property:config:TextDocument:text']\nData rows: 10\n```\n\nStill verifying that it doesn't hit anything else as a side effect.",
